{"id":"90ebdc5f6dcdaf9b","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-cor-banach.md","title":"Banach-Tarski Corollary","display":"cor-banach — Banach-Tarski Corollary","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-banach","aliases":["58-cor-banach"],"display":"cor-banach — Banach-Tarski Corollary","depends_on":["[[../batch08/58-thm-banach-tarski.md]]","[[../batch08/58-df-sphere.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-banach"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-banach</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-banach — Banach-Tarski Corollary"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"93df685cc0032d09\" href=\"?note=93df685cc0032d09\" title=\"../batch08/58-thm-banach-tarski.md\">../batch08/58-thm-banach-tarski.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ed44d43cf74ca35e\" href=\"?note=ed44d43cf74ca35e\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-sphere.md\">../batch08/58-df-sphere.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S^2=\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^3:\\lVert x\\rVert_2=1\\}\">\\(S^2=\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^3:\\lVert x\\rVert_2=1\\}\\)</span> (单位球面, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ed44d43cf74ca35e\" href=\"?note=ed44d43cf74ca35e\" title=\"../batch08/58-df-sphere.md\">../batch08/58-df-sphere.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{SO}(3)=\\{g\\in\\mathbb R^{3\\times3}:g^{\\mathsf T}g=I_3\\land\\det(g)=1\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{SO}(3)=\\{g\\in\\mathbb R^{3\\times3}:g^{\\mathsf T}g=I_3\\land\\det(g)=1\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZFC}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZFC}\\)</span> (含选择公理的背景理论)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}banach}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ZFC}}\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\exists m,n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;&amp;\\exists(A_i)_{i&lt;m}\\;\\exists(C_j)_{j&lt;n}\\;\n\\exists(g_i)_{i&lt;m}\\;\\exists(h_j)_{j&lt;n}\\;\\Bigl(\nS^2=\\Bigl(\\bigsqcup_{i&lt;m}A_i\\Bigr)\\sqcup\\Bigl(\\bigsqcup_{j&lt;n}C_j\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i&lt;m\\;(g_i\\in\\operatorname{SO}(3))\n\\land\\forall j&lt;n\\;(h_j\\in\\operatorname{SO}(3))\\\\\n&amp;\\land S^2=\\bigsqcup_{i&lt;m}g_i[A_i]\n\\land S^2=\\bigsqcup_{j&lt;n}h_j[C_j]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}banach}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ZFC}}\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\exists m,n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;&amp;\\exists(A_i)_{i&lt;m}\\;\\exists(C_j)_{j&lt;n}\\;\n\\exists(g_i)_{i&lt;m}\\;\\exists(h_j)_{j&lt;n}\\;\\Bigl(\nS^2=\\Bigl(\\bigsqcup_{i&lt;m}A_i\\Bigr)\\sqcup\\Bigl(\\bigsqcup_{j&lt;n}C_j\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall i&lt;m\\;(g_i\\in\\operatorname{SO}(3))\n\\land\\forall j&lt;n\\;(h_j\\in\\operatorname{SO}(3))\\\\\n&amp;\\land S^2=\\bigsqcup_{i&lt;m}g_i[A_i]\n\\land S^2=\\bigsqcup_{j&lt;n}h_j[C_j]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The unit sphere is paradoxical under rotations; the Hausdorff sphere decomposition plus absorption of the exceptional countable orbit yields the full-sphere statement.</li>\n<li>The pieces are necessarily nonmeasurable; the result uses choice.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch08/58-thm-banach-tarski.md","status":"resolved","id":"93df685cc0032d09","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-thm-banach-tarski.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-sphere.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed44d43cf74ca35e","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch08/58-df-sphere.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch08/58-df-sphere.md","status":"resolved","id":"ed44d43cf74ca35e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S^2=\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^3:\\lVert x\\rVert_2=1\\}$ (单位球面, see [[../batch08/58-df-sphere.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"S^2=\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^3:\\lVert x\\rVert_2=1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{SO}(3)=\\{g\\in\\mathbb R^{3\\times3}:g^{\\mathsf T}g=I_3\\land\\det(g)=1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZFC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}banach}\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ZFC}}\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\exists m,n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;&\\exists(A_i)_{i<m}\\;\\exists(C_j)_{j<n}\\;\n\\exists(g_i)_{i<m}\\;\\exists(h_j)_{j<n}\\;\\Bigl(\nS^2=\\Bigl(\\bigsqcup_{i<m}A_i\\Bigr)\\sqcup\\Bigl(\\bigsqcup_{j<n}C_j\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall i<m\\;(g_i\\in\\operatorname{SO}(3))\n\\land\\forall j<n\\;(h_j\\in\\operatorname{SO}(3))\\\\\n&\\land S^2=\\bigsqcup_{i<m}g_i[A_i]\n\\land S^2=\\bigsqcup_{j<n}h_j[C_j]\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1271,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-28","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-cor-banach.md|58-cor-banach]]（batch06）"}],"outgoing":["93df685cc0032d09","ed44d43cf74ca35e"]}